Subject: [PATCH 1/8] feat: add TMA load alignment check and related
 functionality

---
 .../TritonGPU/Transforms/PipeliningUtility.h  |  4 ++++
 .../Transforms/Pipeliner/AssignLatencies.cpp  |  9 ++++++++-
 .../Transforms/Pipeliner/LowerLoops.cpp       |  3 ++-
